mission "A Rumour on the Water"
    category "ambient"
    ambient true
    offer_at "sea"
    repeatable true
    cooldown 180
    max_triggers 1
    priority 10
    offer_expression "at_sea and speed > 5 and flag('sea_rumour_heard') == false"
    speaker offer "A sailor in a passing launch"
    on offer
        conversation
            `A little launch comes alongside at a respectful distance. Its sail is patched in three places, and the man at the tiller has the weathered look of someone who has spent more nights at sea than ashore.`
            `"Captain! A word, if you please. I've come down from the northern cays. There's talk of a new pirate captain buying powder and shot in every harbour from here to Havana."`
            choice
                `"What name are they giving this captain?"`
                `"Rumour travels faster than a good ship. I'll keep my eyes open."`
                    set_flag "sea_rumour_heard" true
                    close
            `"No name yet, captain. Only that the ships are gathering, and that someone has paid very well to keep their business quiet."`
            `The sailor raises two fingers in farewell and turns his launch back towards the islands.`
            set_flag "sea_rumour_heard" true
